I walk with my big suitcase.
There is a door in front of me.
It is very heavy.
A friendly woman smiles at me.
She helps me with the door.
"Thank you very much," I say.
"You are welcome," she says.
I smile.
"My name is Maya."
"Hi Maya," says the woman.
"My name is Sofie."
"Hi Sofie," I say.
We say goodbye, and she goes her way.
